{"ref":"powerup:max-health","lead":[{"k":"figure","i":"Sprite-Max_Health.png","w":128,"h":120,"c":[]},{"k":"p","c":["Max Health is one of the player stats in Vampire Survivors. It determines how much health the player's character can have in total."]},{"k":"p","c":["The base value of Max Health is 100 before modifications, such as the characters' bonuses or PowerUps. The characters' Max Health modification is additive. Max Health modifications from PowerUps and items are calculated after the character modification and stack multiplicatively."]},{"k":"p","c":["There is no upper limit to how much Max Health the player can have."]},{"k":"p","c":["Max Health also affects:"]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Base Damage and ",{"t":"Amount","r":"powerup:amount"}," of ",{"i":"Sprite-Mazo_Familiar.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:mazo-familiar"}," ",{"t":"Mazo Familiar","r":"weapon:mazo-familiar"}]},{"c":["Damage of explosions created by ",{"i":"Sprite-Vanitas_Whip.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:vanitas-whip"}," ",{"t":"Vanitas Whip","r":"weapon:vanitas-whip"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OdeToCastlevania.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ode to Castlevania DLC to access"}]}]},{"k":"p","c":["The amount of missing Health affects ",{"t":"Cooldown","r":"powerup:cooldown"}," of ",{"i":"Sprite-Metal_Claw.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:metal-claw"}," ",{"t":"Metal Claw","r":"weapon:metal-claw"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OperationGuns.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Operation Guns DLC to access"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["With ",{"i":"Sprite-Divine_Bloodline_(IX).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"weapon:divine-bloodline-ix"}," ",{"t":"Divine Bloodline (IX)","r":"weapon:divine-bloodline-ix"}," activated, all weapons gain +0.1 flat damage per missing Health, uncapped."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"PowerUp","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["27 October 2021 (Update)"]]},{"label":"ID","cells":[["MAXHEALTH"]]},{"label":"Max level","cells":[["3"]]},{"label":"Bonus per level","cells":[["+10%"]]},{"label":"Stacking","cells":[["Multiplicative"]]},{"label":"Max effect","cells":[["+33.1%"]]},{"label":"Initial cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 200"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"powerup","title":"PowerUp","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["The Max Health PowerUp increases Max Health exponentially, multiplying it by 1.1 each rank up to a maximum rank of 3. At rank 3, it multiplies Max Health by 1.331. It initially costs ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 200."]},{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Rank"],"h":1},{"c":["Max Health"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":["1"]},{"c":["1.1x"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["2"]},{"c":["1.21x"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["3"]},{"c":["1.331x"]}]}]},{"k":"p","c":["The calculation of initial Max Health is done differently from other stats, similarly to that of ",{"t":"Magnet","r":"powerup:magnet"},":"]},{"k":"p","c":["Max Health=(100+character bonus)*PowerUp multiplier"]},{"k":"p","c":["For example, ",{"i":"Sprite-Poe_Ratcho.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:poe-ratcho"}," ",{"t":"Poe","r":"character:poe-ratcho"}," reduces Max Health by 30, so using Poe with the PowerUp at rank 3, Max Health would be:"]},{"k":"p","c":["(100−30)*1.331=93.17"]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"from-items","title":"From items","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Max Health's associated passive item is ",{"i":"Sprite-Hollow_Heart.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:hollow-heart"}," ",{"t":"Hollow Heart","r":"passive:hollow-heart"},", which multiplies Max Health by 1.2 each time it is leveled up. Its maximum level is 5. At level 5 it provides a 2.49x multiplier to Max Health."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Metaglio_Left.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:metaglio-left"}," ",{"t":"Metaglio Left","r":"passive:metaglio-left"}," multiplies Max Health by 1.05 each time it is leveled up. Its maximum level is 9. At level it provides a 1.477x multiplier to Max Health."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Paranormal_Scan.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:paranormal-scan"}," ",{"t":"Paranormal Scan","r":"weapon:paranormal-scan"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-EmergencyMeeting.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Emergency Meeting DLC to access"}," has a chance of granting a Max Health stat bonus of +20 upon activation."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Golden_Egg.png","w":22,"h":24}," Golden Eggs can permanently increase Max Health by +1 for the character that collected it."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"from-arcana","title":"From arcana","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Awake_(IV).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:awake-iv"}," ",{"t":"Awake (IV)","r":"arcana:awake-iv"}," provides +10% Max Health per ",{"i":"Sprite-Revival.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:revival"}," ",{"t":"Revival","r":"powerup:revival"}," consumed."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Divine_Bloodline_(IX).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"weapon:divine-bloodline-ix"}," ",{"t":"Divine Bloodline (IX)","r":"weapon:divine-bloodline-ix"}," provides +0.5 Max Health per enemy killed by retaliatory damage."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"from-darkana","title":"From darkana","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Crystal_Cries_(XII).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:crystal-cries-xii"}," ",{"t":"Crystal Cries (XII)","r":"arcana:crystal-cries-xii"}," generates crystals when killing frozen enemies that can be collected to slightly increase Max Health, ",{"i":"Sprite-Recovery.png","w":24,"h":21,"r":"powerup:recovery"}," ",{"t":"Recovery","r":"powerup:recovery"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Growth.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:growth"}," ",{"t":"Growth","r":"powerup:growth"},"."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"from-survarot","title":"From survarot","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Survarot of Antonio Belpaese provides +80 Max Health. ",{"i":"Sprite-Gala.png","w":64,"h":17}," Survarot of Antonio Belpaese provides +5 Max Health every level."]},{"c":["Survarot of Gennaro Belpaese provides +30 Max Health every 5 levels (Max 5 times)."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"from-characters","title":"From characters","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items